<article class="env-lemma" id="05KF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05KF">Lemma <span data-tag="05KF">10.28.9</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. Let $S$ be a multiplicative subset of $R$. An ideal $I \subset R$ which is maximal with respect to the property that $I \cap S = \emptyset $ is prime. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
